"The connection to the {name} was lost. Make sure the {name} is switched on; "
"OpenCutter reconnects by itself."
msgstr ""
"La connexion à la {name} a été perdue. Vérifiez que la {name} est allumée ; "
"OpenCutter se reconnecte tout seul."

